    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic, nostalgic puzzle game with a delicious twist!<br><br>Solve levels by flipping cookies into the matching cookie. Pay attention to the pattern to solve the level with the least number of flips. <br><br>Tired of Match 3, and want a change? Try Cookie Flipper today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, nostalgic pixel art puzzle game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score tracking based on the minimum number of moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay any level to get the optimal score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >72 preset levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Near infinite custom levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hint button to help solve any level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, relaxing sound track</p></li></ul>",
